1
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:42,000
[Episode 28]

2
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:44,719
One, two, three!

3
00:01:44,719 --> 00:01:46,879
Cheese!

4
00:01:46,879 --> 00:01:48,400
Congratulations on your wedding.

5
00:01:48,400 --> 00:01:49,519
Thank you.

6
00:01:49,519 --> 00:01:50,680
Happy wedding. Happy wedding.

7
00:01:50,680 --> 00:01:51,959
- Alright, time to go.
- Drive safely.

8
00:01:51,959 --> 00:01:53,159
I'll walk you out.

9
00:01:53,159 --> 00:01:54,640
Bye. See you later.

10
00:01:54,640 --> 00:01:56,239
- Wu's here.
- Thank you.

11
00:01:56,239 --> 00:01:57,880
Bye-bye.

12
00:01:57,880 --> 00:01:59,079
Sorry I'm late.

13
00:01:59,079 --> 00:02:02,319
- Wu, what took you so long?
- Happy wedding.

14
00:02:02,319 --> 00:02:04,519
You're so late. Qing Ye already left.

15
00:02:04,519 --> 00:02:06,319
Wu, how come you're this late?

16
00:02:06,319 --> 00:02:08,159
You're way too late.

17
00:02:08,159 --> 00:02:09,719
My flight was delayed.

18
00:02:09,719 --> 00:02:10,960
Wu, you know what?

19
00:02:10,960 --> 00:02:13,520
You really missed a big moment at Zhazhating.

20
00:02:13,520 --> 00:02:14,599
Too bad.

21
00:02:14,599 --> 00:02:16,840
- I'll catch it next time.
- It's fine.

22
00:02:16,840 --> 00:02:18,879
Just wait for Fuzz's wedding.

23
00:02:18,879 --> 00:02:20,400
Hold on, my wedding?

24
00:02:20,400 --> 00:02:21,960
We'll all be waiting for you.

25
00:02:21,960 --> 00:02:24,360
- Well, let's go walk the guests out.
- Okay.

26
00:02:24,360 --> 00:02:25,520
- Let's go, let's go.
- Wu.

27
00:02:25,520 --> 00:02:27,120
- We'll leave you to it.
- Go ahead and chat.

28
00:02:27,120 --> 00:02:28,319
Go on, go on.

29
00:02:28,319 --> 00:02:30,240
Have a good talk with him.

30
00:02:32,039 --> 00:02:33,479
Wu.

31
00:02:33,479 --> 00:02:34,599
See?

32
00:02:34,599 --> 00:02:35,759
You jealous or something?

33
00:02:35,759 --> 00:02:37,120
Look how happy they are.

34
00:02:37,120 --> 00:02:39,560
I'm actually starting to want to get married.

35
00:02:39,560 --> 00:02:41,275
You?

36
00:02:41,275 --> 00:02:43,360
Get a girlfriend first.

37
00:02:43,360 --> 00:02:45,960
You're making fun of me, aren't you?

38
00:02:45,960 --> 00:02:47,986
What, are you in a relationship?

39
00:02:49,879 --> 00:02:51,360
Alright, we haven't taken a photo yet.

40
00:02:51,360 --> 00:02:52,400
Let's take one together.

41
00:02:52,400 --> 00:02:53,840
Move back a bit.

42
00:02:53,840 --> 00:02:55,879
The light's better here. Come on.

43
00:02:55,879 --> 00:02:59,039
One, two, three.

44
00:02:59,919 --> 00:03:01,520
Okay.

45
00:03:01,520 --> 00:03:03,319
I'm going to post this on my Moments.

46
00:03:12,439 --> 00:03:13,520
You picked a good spot.

47
00:03:13,520 --> 00:03:15,439
Qing Ye was sitting right here just now.

48
00:03:16,759 --> 00:03:18,280
Is that so?

49
00:04:26,519 --> 00:04:27,920
Mom, let me do it.

50
00:04:27,920 --> 00:04:30,439
No need. Just rest up.

51
00:04:30,439 --> 00:04:32,513
You don't get to come home often.

52
00:04:34,319 --> 00:04:37,279
Actually, I've got something to tell you.

53
00:04:37,279 --> 00:04:38,439
Go ahead.

54
00:04:38,439 --> 00:04:41,000
I'm planning to go work in Beijing.

55
00:04:41,000 --> 00:04:42,519
Beijing?

56
00:04:42,519 --> 00:04:44,480
So the internship is set?

57
00:04:44,480 --> 00:04:45,600
Yes, it's set.

58
00:04:45,600 --> 00:04:47,839
Prof. Lu got me an internship at Aofei Group.

59
00:04:47,839 --> 00:04:50,560
I'll be doing my master's
while working on projects.

60
00:04:50,560 --> 00:04:53,720
Aofei Group?

61
00:04:53,720 --> 00:04:55,920
You mean the one that makes planes?

62
00:04:57,240 --> 00:04:59,090
Yeah, I know. You can't talk.

63
00:04:59,090 --> 00:05:00,640
It's a secret.

64
00:05:00,640 --> 00:05:04,279
Guess I'll be really busy in Beijing.

65
00:05:04,279 --> 00:05:08,000
Might not be able to come back often.

66
00:05:10,439 --> 00:05:11,920
That's fine.

67
00:05:11,920 --> 00:05:16,920
You just study hard and work hard in Beijing.

68
00:05:16,920 --> 00:05:21,199
I'll be here at Zhazhating
being a career woman.

69
00:05:21,199 --> 00:05:25,360
I'll go see you in Beijing when I can.

70
00:05:26,920 --> 00:05:28,399
Oh, right.

71
00:05:28,399 --> 00:05:30,120
Wait a second.

72
00:05:30,120 --> 00:05:32,360
There's something I need you
to take care of in Beijing.

73
00:05:32,360 --> 00:05:36,000
- What's this?
- Do you remember when our house caught fire,

74
00:05:36,000 --> 00:05:38,839
and Ye's dad lent us 100,000 yuan?

75
00:05:38,839 --> 00:05:40,519
We promised to pay him back.

76
00:05:40,519 --> 00:05:42,000
Help me with it.

77
00:05:42,000 --> 00:05:43,000
Just keep the money.

78
00:05:43,000 --> 00:05:45,360
Listen, you need to get along with Ye.

79
00:05:45,360 --> 00:05:47,399
And you know what that means?
No debt, no worries.

80
00:05:47,399 --> 00:05:49,750
I already paid it back.

81
00:05:49,750 --> 00:05:51,560
You did?

82
00:05:51,560 --> 00:05:52,920
I did.

83
00:05:52,920 --> 00:05:55,000
When did you do that?

84
00:05:58,600 --> 00:06:01,879
Uncle, you lent us money back in the day.

85
00:06:01,879 --> 00:06:06,120
Now I'm paying you back with interest.

86
00:06:12,800 --> 00:06:16,600
I never meant for you to pay me back.

87
00:06:16,600 --> 00:06:20,519
Just because you don't want it back
doesn't mean we shouldn't return it.

88
00:06:20,519 --> 00:06:24,079
Besides, my mom wrote an IOU.

89
00:06:24,079 --> 00:06:25,439
Please take it.

90
00:06:25,439 --> 00:06:27,519
100,000 yuan.

91
00:06:27,519 --> 00:06:29,879
That's no small change.

92
00:06:29,879 --> 00:06:34,439
No wonder you never came home
for winter or summer break all these years.

93
00:06:34,439 --> 00:06:36,120
That must've been really hard.

94
00:06:36,120 --> 00:06:37,160
No big deal.

95
00:06:37,160 --> 00:06:40,639
You know, I designed an aircraft power model.

96
00:06:40,639 --> 00:06:43,079
A company bought the patent.

97
00:06:43,079 --> 00:06:45,600
I get dividends every year.

98
00:06:45,600 --> 00:06:46,839
Dividends?

99
00:06:46,839 --> 00:06:48,519
How much?

100
00:06:49,959 --> 00:06:51,639
Not telling you.

101
00:06:52,319 --> 00:06:54,519
Fine, keep it to yourself.

102
00:06:54,519 --> 00:06:58,279
I'm just trying to keep you hungry for success.

103
00:06:58,879 --> 00:07:01,160
I've got plenty of drive already.

104
00:07:01,160 --> 00:07:05,239
I opened a branch in Anzi County, you know.

105
00:07:05,239 --> 00:07:07,079
Keep it up.

106
00:07:09,040 --> 00:07:11,000
By the way, now that you're off to Beijing,

107
00:07:11,000 --> 00:07:14,360
don't forget to see Ye
and keep in touch with her.

108
00:07:16,160 --> 00:07:18,800
- Okay.
- Promise me you'll do it.

109
00:07:19,560 --> 00:07:21,000
Of course.

110
00:07:26,319 --> 00:07:29,319
Wu left so soon?

111
00:07:29,319 --> 00:07:31,040
He went back to Beijing.

112
00:07:31,040 --> 00:07:34,720
His advisor thinks a lot of him

113
00:07:34,720 --> 00:07:37,759
and got him an internship over there.

114
00:07:37,759 --> 00:07:40,240
- Wow, that's really something.
- Yeah.

115
00:07:40,240 --> 00:07:43,160
Xi Xi, your son just got married.

116
00:07:43,160 --> 00:07:44,920
And now there's more good news.

117
00:07:44,920 --> 00:07:48,000
Double the joy.

118
00:07:48,000 --> 00:07:50,519
Seriously, Wu's had it really rough.

119
00:07:50,519 --> 00:07:52,120
But after everything,

120
00:07:52,120 --> 00:07:54,959
he still made it into a good college
and lived his dream.

121
00:07:54,959 --> 00:07:56,839
And he even moved to Beijing.

122
00:07:56,839 --> 00:07:58,839
That's so inspiring.

123
00:07:58,839 --> 00:08:02,959
Wu saved up 100,000 yuan over the years

124
00:08:02,959 --> 00:08:06,600
without telling me a thing
and just gave it back to Ye's dad.

125
00:08:06,600 --> 00:08:10,560
I can only imagine
how hard it's been for him out there.

126
00:08:10,560 --> 00:08:12,839
Wu's such a good kid.

127
00:08:12,839 --> 00:08:14,319
He handles everything on his own.

128
00:08:14,319 --> 00:08:15,519
I know.

129
00:08:15,519 --> 00:08:18,199
Honestly, I have an angel for a son.

130
00:08:18,199 --> 00:08:19,639
I'm so blessed.

131
00:08:19,639 --> 00:08:22,800
Thanks to your angel son
for taking Hu under his wing.

132
00:08:22,800 --> 00:08:25,512
Now I don't have to worry about him anymore.

133
00:08:25,512 --> 00:08:30,145
Time for me to go after
my new life and new career.

134
00:08:30,145 --> 00:08:31,920
- What are you going to do?
- What are you going to do?

135
00:08:31,920 --> 00:08:35,879
I want to do livestreaming too.

136
00:08:35,879 --> 00:08:36,919
What do you think?

137
00:08:36,919 --> 00:08:38,720
- Great idea.
- Totally works.

138
00:08:38,720 --> 00:08:39,840
Yeah.

139
00:08:39,840 --> 00:08:40,960
But I'm not like you.

140
00:08:40,960 --> 00:08:43,360
I don't have any real skills.

141
00:08:43,360 --> 00:08:46,399
I can only make some noodles or dumplings.

142
00:08:46,399 --> 00:08:47,879
That's perfect.

143
00:08:47,879 --> 00:08:50,399
You can go live while cooking
and then sell stuff.

144
00:08:50,399 --> 00:08:54,960
Exactly. Plus, Zhazhating's got
all these local specialties and seafood.

145
00:08:54,960 --> 00:08:56,159
Just go for it.

146
00:08:56,159 --> 00:08:57,200
No rush.

147
00:08:57,200 --> 00:08:59,879
Fang, I'll learn from you first.

148
00:08:59,879 --> 00:09:02,080
Learn bit by bit, livestream bit by bit.

149
00:09:02,080 --> 00:09:03,639
But I'm setting a goal.

150
00:09:03,639 --> 00:09:08,159
I'll become a top streamer
with over 100,000 followers.

151
00:09:08,159 --> 00:09:10,360
You got this.

152
00:09:10,360 --> 00:09:13,720
No doubt about it.

153
00:09:17,619 --> 00:09:21,279
Our development direction and core strategy
are broken down into three parts.

154
00:09:21,279 --> 00:09:25,519
What you're seeing now
is the heart of Changdao fish farm.

155
00:09:25,519 --> 00:09:30,039
We'll carry out a full-scale industrial
chain upgrade and sales model innovation.

156
00:09:30,039 --> 00:09:32,799
Like setting up a cold chain logistics hub.

157
00:09:32,799 --> 00:09:36,519
Of course,

158
00:09:36,519 --> 00:09:39,399
we'll also develop tourism.

159
00:09:39,399 --> 00:09:42,399
Changdao has great natural environment.

160
00:09:42,399 --> 00:09:44,600
We can open up scenic walkways,

161
00:09:44,600 --> 00:09:48,360
sea fishing, family beachcombing,
and bonfire parties.

162
00:09:48,360 --> 00:09:50,320
On top of that,

163
00:09:50,320 --> 00:09:53,240
our project's got strong backing
from the local government.

164
00:09:53,240 --> 00:09:56,840
So I believe things will work out really well.

165
00:09:56,840 --> 00:09:59,840
Well, that's the whole cooperation plan

166
00:09:59,840 --> 00:10:03,600
between Guanshan Ventures and Creation Tech.

167
00:10:03,600 --> 00:10:04,759
For us,

168
00:10:04,759 --> 00:10:09,039
Creation Tech's project helping farmers
isn't just business.

169
00:10:09,039 --> 00:10:10,919
It's personal.

170
00:10:10,919 --> 00:10:15,159
And we're not just investing in the seafood.

171
00:10:15,159 --> 00:10:17,840
It's more about the people behind it.

172
00:10:17,840 --> 00:10:21,279
They live by the sea,

173
00:10:21,279 --> 00:10:23,679
resilient like water, deep as the ocean.

174
00:10:23,679 --> 00:10:27,080
They're unstoppable and hardworking.

175
00:10:27,080 --> 00:10:29,519
Other people may see

176
00:10:29,519 --> 00:10:34,320
this kind of project as a dead end or a grind.

177
00:10:34,320 --> 00:10:36,639
But to us,

178
00:10:37,200 --> 00:10:40,120
it's a treasure, a blue ocean.

179
00:10:52,240 --> 00:10:55,080
- Thank you.
- It's a pleasure to work with you.

180
00:10:55,080 --> 00:10:57,919
We really appreciate all your support and help.

181
00:10:57,919 --> 00:10:59,120
Thank you so much.

182
00:10:59,120 --> 00:11:01,200
Let's make this project a success together.

183
00:11:01,200 --> 00:11:04,159
Thank you for your efforts and contributions
to Changdao's development.

184
00:11:04,159 --> 00:11:07,299
- Happy cooperation.
- To a great partnership.

185
00:11:18,919 --> 00:11:20,639
Meng Rui Hang?

186
00:11:22,360 --> 00:11:23,519
Why are you still here?

187
00:11:23,519 --> 00:11:26,960
Let's go together. My treat, to celebrate.

188
00:11:26,960 --> 00:11:28,840
This is only the beginning.

189
00:11:28,840 --> 00:11:31,120
We still have to go to Changdao
for more research.

190
00:11:31,120 --> 00:11:32,759
Right now it's all just ideas.

191
00:11:32,759 --> 00:11:34,200
Plenty more work to come.

192
00:11:34,200 --> 00:11:36,519
Didn't you just get back from Zhazhating?

193
00:11:36,519 --> 00:11:38,279
Did you see Xing Wu?

194
00:11:44,559 --> 00:11:46,440
What happened?

195
00:11:49,480 --> 00:11:51,840
When I'm done with this rush, I'll treat you.

196
00:11:51,840 --> 00:11:55,200
Now I just want to get home and rest.

197
00:11:55,200 --> 00:11:57,759
Alright, go back and rest.

198
00:12:16,559 --> 00:12:18,120
Xing Wu.

199
00:12:18,759 --> 00:12:20,120
Hi there.

200
00:12:20,120 --> 00:12:22,679
I'm so sorry. Traffic was awful.

201
00:12:22,679 --> 00:12:24,519
I should've picked you up.

202
00:12:24,519 --> 00:12:26,279
Just had too much going on today.
Couldn't get away.

203
00:12:26,279 --> 00:12:27,879
It's fine. I'm here anyway.

204
00:12:27,879 --> 00:12:30,360
Prof. Lu had me book a private room
to welcome you.

205
00:12:30,360 --> 00:12:32,200
He'll be here soon. Let's go in first.

206
00:12:32,200 --> 00:12:34,360
Okay. You were late.

207
00:12:34,360 --> 00:12:36,759
- So you get to handle the luggage.
- Of course. I'll do it.

208
00:13:24,640 --> 00:13:27,739
[Download]
[Image saved]

209
00:13:41,080 --> 00:13:43,000
See you at the usual place.

210
00:13:44,279 --> 00:13:45,320
You okay?

211
00:13:45,320 --> 00:13:47,399
What's with the late-night meal?

212
00:13:47,399 --> 00:13:50,000
Working overtime. No time to eat.

213
00:13:50,000 --> 00:13:51,559
I'm hungry.

214
00:13:51,559 --> 00:13:52,879
- Excuse me.
- Hello.

215
00:13:52,879 --> 00:13:55,120
- What would you like to order?
- The usual three.

216
00:13:55,120 --> 00:13:56,919
Okay, just a moment, please.

217
00:13:56,919 --> 00:13:58,320
You think I'm buying that?

218
00:13:58,320 --> 00:13:59,759
You asked me to meet this late.

219
00:13:59,759 --> 00:14:01,360
Something's definitely going on.

220
00:14:01,360 --> 00:14:03,840
I want it this way. I missed you.

221
00:14:03,840 --> 00:14:05,120
Save it.

222
00:14:05,120 --> 00:14:07,159
We were roommates for four years.

223
00:14:07,159 --> 00:14:08,679
I know how you work.

224
00:14:08,679 --> 00:14:10,080
Tell me the truth.

225
00:14:10,080 --> 00:14:12,600
You're missing your first love, aren't you?

226
00:14:13,440 --> 00:14:14,600
Of course not.

227
00:14:14,600 --> 00:14:16,559
That's all in the past.

228
00:14:16,559 --> 00:14:18,200
In the past?

229
00:14:18,200 --> 00:14:20,679
So how come you've been single for five years?

230
00:14:20,679 --> 00:14:24,200
I just haven't met the right one.

231
00:14:24,200 --> 00:14:26,000
Fine, fine.

232
00:14:28,879 --> 00:14:29,919
- Prof. Lu.
- Prof. Lu.

233
00:14:29,919 --> 00:14:31,559
Sorry, I'm late.

234
00:14:31,559 --> 00:14:32,919
It's fine. We just got here.

235
00:14:32,919 --> 00:14:35,320
- Alright, sit down.
- Come on, sit, sit.

236
00:14:36,000 --> 00:14:37,000
Come on.

237
00:14:37,000 --> 00:14:39,320
To our reunion.

238
00:14:39,320 --> 00:14:41,039
- Cheers.
- Cheers.

239
00:14:41,039 --> 00:14:42,039
Thank you, Prof. Lu.

240
00:14:42,039 --> 00:14:43,759
Thank you, Prof. Lu.

241
00:14:50,240 --> 00:14:52,799
Here are your key cards, meal cards,

242
00:14:52,799 --> 00:14:54,519
and employee handbooks for Aofei.

243
00:14:54,519 --> 00:14:55,919
All in here.

244
00:14:55,919 --> 00:15:00,679
Starting tomorrow,
you two are colleagues on the project team.

245
00:15:00,679 --> 00:15:02,320
Do a good job.

246
00:15:02,320 --> 00:15:04,240
Thank you for the opportunity.

247
00:15:04,240 --> 00:15:05,639
By the way,

248
00:15:05,639 --> 00:15:06,960
I just got back from my hometown.

249
00:15:06,960 --> 00:15:08,399
I brought you some local seafood.

250
00:15:08,399 --> 00:15:09,759
- Okay.
- I'll leave it here

251
00:15:09,759 --> 00:15:10,840
and get it to your car in a bit.

252
00:15:10,840 --> 00:15:12,279
Okay.

253
00:15:15,960 --> 00:15:19,320
Tell me, why the drinking?

254
00:15:19,320 --> 00:15:21,399
Because I'm unhappy.

255
00:15:21,399 --> 00:15:24,080
Because of your first love?

256
00:15:26,840 --> 00:15:28,759
I miss him.

257
00:15:28,759 --> 00:15:30,399
I miss him like crazy.

258
00:15:30,399 --> 00:15:32,360
Every day.

259
00:15:32,360 --> 00:15:34,240
It's been five years.

260
00:15:34,240 --> 00:15:36,639
Doesn't he miss me?

261
00:15:36,639 --> 00:15:38,120
How could...

262
00:15:38,120 --> 00:15:41,040
How could he just not contact me at all?

263
00:15:41,040 --> 00:15:43,759
If you miss him, go find him.

264
00:15:44,320 --> 00:15:45,600
I have my pride.

265
00:15:45,600 --> 00:15:48,360
I'm the one who ended things.

266
00:15:48,360 --> 00:15:50,040
Why?

267
00:15:51,039 --> 00:15:52,759
I wanted to push him.

268
00:15:52,759 --> 00:15:54,399
I was afraid he'd give up.

269
00:15:54,399 --> 00:15:55,600
And he said it himself.

270
00:15:55,600 --> 00:15:57,279
Move forward. Don't look back.

271
00:15:57,279 --> 00:15:58,759
He'd catch up.

272
00:15:58,759 --> 00:16:00,600
You actually buy that?

273
00:16:00,600 --> 00:16:02,919
People change easily.

274
00:16:02,919 --> 00:16:06,039
Truth is, he probably gave up ages ago.

275
00:16:06,039 --> 00:16:08,080
Or he's already forgotten you.

276
00:16:08,080 --> 00:16:10,559
Maybe he really has forgotten me.

277
00:16:12,159 --> 00:16:15,559
Do you still have any way to reach him?

278
00:16:15,559 --> 00:16:18,000
I have his phone number.

279
00:16:18,000 --> 00:16:19,720
Give me your phone.

280
00:16:19,720 --> 00:16:21,440
What for?

281
00:16:29,407 --> 00:16:31,799
Xing Wu, you just got to Beijing.

282
00:16:31,799 --> 00:16:33,320
Did you find a place to stay yet?

283
00:16:33,320 --> 00:16:36,000
Yeah, I found one. It's right near here.

284
00:16:36,000 --> 00:16:38,039
Prof. Lu, you know Xing Wu.

285
00:16:38,039 --> 00:16:41,279
Always prepared for everything.

286
00:16:41,279 --> 00:16:42,320
What about you?

287
00:16:42,320 --> 00:16:44,240
My sister's in Beijing. I'm going to her place.

288
00:16:44,240 --> 00:16:45,240
Good, good.

289
00:16:45,240 --> 00:16:48,440
You guys give it your all

290
00:16:48,440 --> 00:16:49,639
and build a life in Beijing.

291
00:16:49,639 --> 00:16:51,200
- Come on.
- We will.

292
00:16:51,200 --> 00:16:53,000
Okay.

293
00:16:53,000 --> 00:16:54,919
It was just a call that didn't go through.

294
00:16:54,919 --> 00:16:56,639
Why did you have to drink so much?

295
00:16:56,639 --> 00:16:58,120
It's not that big a deal.

296
00:16:58,120 --> 00:17:00,360
He didn't see it, I guess.

297
00:17:00,360 --> 00:17:02,279
You... want me to take you home?

298
00:17:02,279 --> 00:17:04,279
No need. My place is close.

299
00:17:04,279 --> 00:17:06,480
I'll take a walk and clear my head.

300
00:17:06,480 --> 00:17:07,640
Your car's here.

301
00:17:07,640 --> 00:17:09,160
Alright. You sure you've got this?

302
00:17:09,160 --> 00:17:11,400
I'm fine. Let me know when you're home.

303
00:17:11,400 --> 00:17:12,640
- I'm leaving then.
- Bye-bye.

304
00:17:12,640 --> 00:17:14,079
Bye.

305
00:17:37,000 --> 00:17:38,440
- Alright, bye.
- Okay.

306
00:17:38,440 --> 00:17:39,519
Take care, Prof. Lu.

307
00:17:39,519 --> 00:17:41,079
See you.

308
00:17:50,799 --> 00:17:52,920
My ride's almost here too.

309
00:18:03,120 --> 00:18:05,319
<i>People change easily.</i>

310
00:18:05,319 --> 00:18:08,640
<i>Truth is, he probably gave up ages ago.</i>

311
00:18:08,640 --> 00:18:11,640
<i>Or he's already forgotten you.</i>

312
00:18:15,240 --> 00:18:19,200
<i>Xing Wu, have you really forgotten?</i>

313
00:18:21,839 --> 00:18:25,960
<i>Will we still get to
spend New Year's together next year?</i>

314
00:18:27,079 --> 00:18:28,960
<i>Next year,</i>

315
00:18:28,960 --> 00:18:30,799
<i>where do you plan to be?</i>

316
00:18:32,000 --> 00:18:36,200
<i>It depends on my Gaokao results.</i>

317
00:18:36,200 --> 00:18:40,360
<i>If things go well, I'd like to come back here.</i>

318
00:19:19,680 --> 00:19:21,960
- Hello?
<i>- Where are you?</i>

319
00:19:21,960 --> 00:19:24,799
<i>I texted you, but you didn't write back.</i>

320
00:19:24,799 --> 00:19:27,119
I'm near my place.

321
00:19:27,119 --> 00:19:28,559
<i>Are you drunk?</i>

322
00:19:28,559 --> 00:19:30,359
No, I'm not.

323
00:20:13,279 --> 00:20:14,400
Qing Ye?

324
00:20:14,400 --> 00:20:16,240
Why did you drink so much?

325
00:20:17,000 --> 00:20:19,319
Come on, I'll walk you back.

326
00:20:49,839 --> 00:20:52,039
Here, have some water.

327
00:20:52,039 --> 00:20:53,640
Xing Wu.

328
00:20:54,599 --> 00:20:56,240
Xing Wu.

329
00:20:57,519 --> 00:20:59,599
Is that you?

330
00:21:07,760 --> 00:21:09,600
It's Meng Rui Hang.

331
00:21:26,519 --> 00:21:27,680
Get some rest.

332
00:21:27,680 --> 00:21:29,359
I'll take my leave.

333
00:22:26,680 --> 00:22:29,279
How did I get home last night?

334
00:22:37,820 --> 00:22:40,440
- Hello?
<i>- You awake?</i>

335
00:22:40,440 --> 00:22:42,079
Yeah, just now.

336
00:22:42,079 --> 00:22:44,359
<i>You doing okay?</i>

337
00:22:44,359 --> 00:22:45,839
I'm fine.

338
00:22:45,839 --> 00:22:47,759
Just a little dizzy.

339
00:22:47,759 --> 00:22:49,880
<i>You drank way too much last night.</i>

340
00:22:49,880 --> 00:22:51,960
<i>I couldn't stop you no matter what.</i>

341
00:22:51,960 --> 00:22:53,839
Look,

342
00:22:54,559 --> 00:22:57,759
starting today,
I'm quitting alcohol for three months.

343
00:22:57,759 --> 00:22:59,079
You keep me in check.

344
00:22:59,079 --> 00:23:01,440
<i>Honestly, it's not alcohol you need to quit.</i>

345
00:23:01,440 --> 00:23:03,039
<i>It's that person who's never coming.</i>

346
00:23:03,039 --> 00:23:04,640
<i>One door closes, another opens.</i>

347
00:23:04,640 --> 00:23:06,680
<i>There's always light somewhere.</i>

348
00:23:06,680 --> 00:23:09,519
What, you're going to set me up
with some good-looking guy?

349
00:23:09,519 --> 00:23:10,680
<i>You guessed it.</i>

350
00:23:10,680 --> 00:23:12,039
<i>He's handsome and in great shape.</i>

351
00:23:12,039 --> 00:23:14,200
<i>- A total good guy.</i>
- How can you be so sure?

352
00:23:14,200 --> 00:23:15,599
<i>Because he's my little brother.</i>

353
00:23:15,599 --> 00:23:16,920
<i>He just got to Beijing.</i>

354
00:23:16,920 --> 00:23:18,039
<i>I'll hook you up with him.</i>

355
00:23:18,039 --> 00:23:20,200
Knock it off. That's way too much for me.

356
00:23:20,200 --> 00:23:22,000
Besides, I'm not looking to date right now.

357
00:23:22,000 --> 00:23:23,759
<i>You're welcome.</i>

358
00:23:23,759 --> 00:23:25,359
<i>We're best friends, aren't we?</i>

359
00:23:25,359 --> 00:23:26,359
Alright, alright.

360
00:23:26,359 --> 00:23:27,680
Matchmaking time is over.

361
00:23:27,680 --> 00:23:28,759
I'm heading to work.

362
00:23:28,759 --> 00:23:32,039
I've got a project wrap-up meeting today.

363
00:23:32,039 --> 00:23:33,839
Hanging up now. Bye.

364
00:23:48,519 --> 00:23:50,920
Think about what I told you this morning.

365
00:23:50,920 --> 00:23:52,960
- You're serious?
- Of course.

366
00:23:52,960 --> 00:23:54,680
Let me give you the rundown.

367
00:23:54,680 --> 00:23:56,559
- Listen up.
- I'm not interested.

368
00:23:56,559 --> 00:23:58,000
My brother's name is Qu Xing.

369
00:23:58,000 --> 00:24:00,680
Graduated from Northwestern Polytechnical
University, now doing his master's.

370
00:24:00,680 --> 00:24:02,359
He just got to Beijing a few days ago

371
00:24:02,359 --> 00:24:06,119
and is now working on a project
at Aofei Group with his advisor.

372
00:24:06,880 --> 00:24:08,640
Great. A young talent.

373
00:24:08,640 --> 00:24:10,240
So what do you think?

374
00:24:10,240 --> 00:24:11,440
No.

375
00:24:11,440 --> 00:24:13,559
It's okay if my brother's not your type.

376
00:24:13,559 --> 00:24:17,640
If you want,
he's got a colleague who's also new to Beijing.

377
00:24:17,640 --> 00:24:19,319
Let's grab dinner tonight.

378
00:24:19,319 --> 00:24:22,279
I still owe him a welcome meal anyway.

379
00:24:22,279 --> 00:24:26,359
Wait, why are you
so eager to set me up all of a sudden?

380
00:24:26,359 --> 00:24:28,839
I just hate seeing you stuck.

381
00:24:28,839 --> 00:24:31,640
They say you have to let go of the old
to make room for the new.

382
00:24:31,640 --> 00:24:35,559
But actually, it's more like
the new helps you move past the old.

383
00:24:36,319 --> 00:24:38,839
Fine. Text me when and where.

384
00:24:38,839 --> 00:24:40,079
So...

385
00:24:40,079 --> 00:24:41,960
you're saying yes?

386
00:24:41,960 --> 00:24:43,160
It's your treat.

387
00:24:43,160 --> 00:24:44,400
I'm not missing a free meal.

388
00:24:44,400 --> 00:24:45,519
Qing Ye.

389
00:24:45,519 --> 00:24:46,759
Hello, Ms. Zhu.

390
00:24:46,759 --> 00:24:49,319
- Ms. Zhu.
- Qing Ye, congratulations.

391
00:24:49,319 --> 00:24:50,720
Your project passed the kickoff meeting.

392
00:24:50,720 --> 00:24:52,720
That fast?

393
00:24:52,720 --> 00:24:54,599
The board really likes this project.

394
00:24:54,599 --> 00:24:56,559
They were banging the table, yelling to go big.

395
00:24:56,559 --> 00:25:00,113
Looks like what you dug up on the beach
wasn't sand. It was gold.

396
00:25:00,113 --> 00:25:02,960
Then I'll hurry and go on a business trip
to Changdao to follow up.

397
00:25:02,960 --> 00:25:04,720
Cool, keep going.

398
00:25:10,640 --> 00:25:13,035
- Engineer Xing, still busy?
- Yes.

399
00:25:17,160 --> 00:25:20,839
Engineer Xing, take a break.
Wake yourself up a bit.

400
00:25:22,599 --> 00:25:24,799
I'm good. You go ahead and drink it.

401
00:25:25,680 --> 00:25:27,759
Man, you really work hard.

402
00:25:27,759 --> 00:25:30,960
I just sent Prof. Lu the design
I stayed up several nights for,

403
00:25:30,960 --> 00:25:32,880
and he told me to come help you.

404
00:25:32,880 --> 00:25:34,319
Don't even go there.

405
00:25:34,319 --> 00:25:35,440
The data's huge.

406
00:25:35,440 --> 00:25:38,039
I just went to the bathroom for a moment
and the processor died.

407
00:25:38,039 --> 00:25:39,289
My sister is treating tonight.

408
00:25:39,289 --> 00:25:41,039
I'll take you along.

409
00:25:41,039 --> 00:25:42,440
Consider it my apology.

410
00:25:42,440 --> 00:25:43,519
Okay?

411
00:25:43,519 --> 00:25:45,440
I'm not going.

412
00:25:45,440 --> 00:25:47,880
Come on, my sister made a point.

413
00:25:47,880 --> 00:25:51,039
She wants me to bring
the best single guy I know to meet her friend.

414
00:25:51,039 --> 00:25:52,519
Please don't say no.

415
00:25:52,519 --> 00:25:54,519
Appreciate it.

416
00:25:54,519 --> 00:25:55,759
But no need.

417
00:25:55,759 --> 00:25:59,039
I know you've got someone in your heart
you can't forget.

418
00:25:59,039 --> 00:26:00,559
But just do me a favor.

419
00:26:00,559 --> 00:26:04,160
If it's really a blind date,
I need you there to back me up.

420
00:26:05,200 --> 00:26:06,400
Look.

421
00:26:06,400 --> 00:26:07,599
This is my sister Qu Bing.

422
00:26:07,599 --> 00:26:09,279
Next to her is her college roommate.

423
00:26:09,279 --> 00:26:11,039
Super smart, graduated from Qingbei.

424
00:26:11,039 --> 00:26:12,319
A rising star in the industry.

425
00:26:12,319 --> 00:26:14,152
Pretty, right?

426
00:26:16,759 --> 00:26:18,960
- Fine, forget it.
- Wait.

427
00:26:21,039 --> 00:26:23,519
I'll go. What time?

428
00:26:25,839 --> 00:26:27,440
So you're into her?

429
00:26:28,079 --> 00:26:29,559
A free meal anyway.

430
00:26:29,559 --> 00:26:31,359
No reason not to go.

431
00:26:33,119 --> 00:26:34,799
It's a deal then.

432
00:26:50,359 --> 00:26:51,839
Let's sit here.

433
00:27:00,279 --> 00:27:01,519
Sir, here's the menu.

434
00:27:01,519 --> 00:27:03,079
- Please take a look.
- You go first.

435
00:27:03,079 --> 00:27:04,519
Okay.

436
00:27:08,039 --> 00:27:09,440
Xing Wu,

437
00:27:09,440 --> 00:27:11,599
you look really handsome in that outfit.

438
00:27:11,599 --> 00:27:13,680
You're stealing my thunder.

439
00:27:13,680 --> 00:27:16,519
- Am I?
- Totally.

440
00:27:16,519 --> 00:27:20,279
You're not trying
to be my brother-in-law, are you?

441
00:27:20,279 --> 00:27:22,240
You're overthinking it.

442
00:27:23,079 --> 00:27:25,000
Trust me, this place is good.

443
00:27:25,000 --> 00:27:28,359
Their signature dishes are steamed egg
with sea urchin and seafood noodles.

444
00:27:28,359 --> 00:27:29,759
All your favorites.

445
00:27:29,759 --> 00:27:32,400
Like I said, I'm just here for the free meal.

446
00:27:32,400 --> 00:27:34,680
Spare me all that talk.

447
00:27:34,680 --> 00:27:35,880
I've got work to do.

448
00:27:35,880 --> 00:27:37,079
Don't worry.

449
00:27:37,079 --> 00:27:39,119
I won't mess with your work at all.

450
00:27:40,920 --> 00:27:42,960
My brother's right there. Xing.

451
00:27:42,960 --> 00:27:44,519
Hey sis.

452
00:28:03,160 --> 00:28:05,160
He really is a handsome guy.

453
00:29:03,519 --> 00:29:05,079
Hello.

454
00:29:06,480 --> 00:29:08,119
I'm Xing Wu.

455
00:29:14,880 --> 00:29:16,599
Xing Wu.

456
00:29:26,359 --> 00:29:29,039
Hello, I'm Qu Bing, Qu Xing's sister.

457
00:29:29,039 --> 00:29:30,559
This is my best friend, Qing Ye.

458
00:29:30,559 --> 00:29:32,519
We were roommates in college.

459
00:29:33,880 --> 00:29:35,400
Qing Ye.

460
00:29:39,279 --> 00:29:40,799
Hello.

461
00:29:47,039 --> 00:29:48,559
Hello.

462
00:30:04,000 --> 00:30:05,280
Let's sit down.

463
00:30:05,280 --> 00:30:07,279
Don't just stand there. Come sit and talk.

464
00:30:07,279 --> 00:30:08,920
- Let's go.
- Okay.

465
00:30:26,640 --> 00:30:27,759
What's wrong?

466
00:30:27,759 --> 00:30:29,799
I'm just a little awkward around new people.

467
00:30:38,721 --> 00:30:39,760
Thank you.

468
00:30:39,760 --> 00:30:41,759
Xing Wu, you're so good at ordering.

469
00:30:41,759 --> 00:30:44,279
These are all Qing Ye's favorites.

470
00:30:44,880 --> 00:30:48,319
Oh yeah? Looks like we really click.

471
00:30:51,319 --> 00:30:52,519
Come on, let's eat.

472
00:30:52,519 --> 00:30:54,160
Dig in.

473
00:31:09,559 --> 00:31:11,200
Thank you.

474
00:31:11,799 --> 00:31:14,599
Are you new to Beijing?

475
00:31:16,720 --> 00:31:17,839
Yes.

476
00:31:17,839 --> 00:31:20,079
I was at
Northwestern Polytechnical University before.

477
00:31:20,079 --> 00:31:23,359
Now I'm here for a project with my advisor.

478
00:31:23,359 --> 00:31:27,400
Just got to Beijing
and already going on a blind date?

479
00:31:29,000 --> 00:31:30,759
I'm just here for the free meal.

480
00:31:30,759 --> 00:31:33,119
Yeah, that's right.
I asked him to come for dinner.

481
00:31:33,119 --> 00:31:36,160
I was afraid
our first meeting would be awkward.

482
00:31:36,160 --> 00:31:37,920
Xing Wu, you're handling this well.

483
00:31:37,920 --> 00:31:39,960
Make me one too.

484
00:31:39,960 --> 00:31:41,160
Why bother him?

485
00:31:41,160 --> 00:31:42,440
Can't you do it yourself?

486
00:31:42,440 --> 00:31:44,599
Hurry up and eat.

487
00:31:45,279 --> 00:31:47,799
You didn't use to wear glasses, right?

488
00:31:47,799 --> 00:31:49,039
How do you know?

489
00:31:49,039 --> 00:31:52,559
He worked too hard in school
and messed up his vision.

490
00:31:52,559 --> 00:31:55,680
- Eat your food.
- Yeah, I can tell.

491
00:31:55,680 --> 00:31:57,000
You're really hardworking.

492
00:31:57,000 --> 00:31:59,240
Guess your career's doing fine.

493
00:31:59,240 --> 00:32:00,640
What about your love life?

494
00:32:00,640 --> 00:32:01,799
Any progress there?

495
00:32:01,799 --> 00:32:03,279
No at all.

496
00:32:05,440 --> 00:32:09,079
There's someone who's always been in my heart.

497
00:32:09,680 --> 00:32:13,359
And besides, I don't have the time.

498
00:32:15,319 --> 00:32:17,200
Someone in your heart?

499
00:32:18,200 --> 00:32:20,440
Then why don't you go find her?

500
00:32:23,920 --> 00:32:25,960
I'm afraid I'm not good enough for her.

501
00:32:25,960 --> 00:32:30,359
So I've been working hard to close the gap.

502
00:32:30,359 --> 00:32:32,000
I can back that up.

503
00:32:32,000 --> 00:32:35,240
Xing Wu's holidays
are all competitions or side work.

504
00:32:35,240 --> 00:32:38,599
No time to see anyone, let alone date.

505
00:32:39,440 --> 00:32:40,640
Xing Wu,

506
00:32:40,640 --> 00:32:41,960
where are you from?

507
00:32:41,960 --> 00:32:43,079
Zhazhating in Anzi County.

508
00:32:43,079 --> 00:32:44,920
Zhazhating?

509
00:32:44,920 --> 00:32:49,880
Qing Ye, your farmer support project
on Changdao is near there, isn't it?

510
00:32:49,880 --> 00:32:51,440
What a coincidence.

511
00:32:51,440 --> 00:32:53,119
You know what?

512
00:32:53,119 --> 00:32:57,119
Xing Wu had a hell of a time
getting out of Zhazhating.

513
00:32:57,119 --> 00:32:58,640
Not that bad.

514
00:32:58,640 --> 00:33:02,319
Good thing I'm finally here in Beijing.

515
00:33:06,400 --> 00:33:08,880
Qing Ye, the desserts here are really good.

516
00:33:08,880 --> 00:33:10,160
Want to get some?

517
00:33:10,160 --> 00:33:12,720
Sure, I love sweets.

518
00:33:12,720 --> 00:33:13,839
Excuse me,

519
00:33:13,839 --> 00:33:15,839
one cheesecake, please.

520
00:33:28,079 --> 00:33:29,519
I said it was my treat.

521
00:33:29,519 --> 00:33:30,640
But you paid instead.

522
00:33:30,640 --> 00:33:31,680
Sorry about that.

523
00:33:31,680 --> 00:33:32,839
No big deal.

524
00:33:32,839 --> 00:33:35,799
I met someone special tonight anyway.

525
00:33:41,640 --> 00:33:43,279
Let's exchange WeChats.

526
00:33:53,519 --> 00:33:55,200
Count me in.

527
00:33:55,200 --> 00:33:56,960
Don't butt in.

528
00:34:00,559 --> 00:34:02,440
Well then, we're leaving.

529
00:34:02,440 --> 00:34:03,720
You two go ahead and chat.

530
00:34:03,720 --> 00:34:05,200
- Where are we going?
- Just move.

531
00:34:05,200 --> 00:34:06,799
- Wait, I...
- Big mistake having you here.

532
00:34:06,799 --> 00:34:08,119
What's wrong with adding her on WeChat?

533
00:34:08,119 --> 00:34:09,440
You idiot.

534
00:34:09,440 --> 00:34:10,880
Let's go.

535
00:34:26,760 --> 00:34:28,239
My ride's here.

536
00:34:28,239 --> 00:34:30,480
Where do you live? I'll take you home.

537
00:34:30,480 --> 00:34:32,079
No need.

538
00:34:32,079 --> 00:34:34,519
I called a car too.
And my place isn't far from here.

539
00:34:34,519 --> 00:34:36,159
You go first.

540
00:34:39,400 --> 00:34:40,800
Then...

541
00:34:40,800 --> 00:34:42,559
let's talk on WeChat.

542
00:34:43,760 --> 00:34:46,159
- See you.
- See you.

543
00:34:50,079 --> 00:34:51,840
Go to bed early.

544
00:35:09,639 --> 00:35:11,800
Sunny day.

545
00:35:14,559 --> 00:35:16,440
Lighthouse.

546
00:35:35,119 --> 00:35:37,519
Qing Ye.

547
00:35:38,440 --> 00:35:40,199
Hello, Uncle. Long time no see.

548
00:35:40,199 --> 00:35:42,840
Hey, Ye. Long time no see.

549
00:35:43,519 --> 00:35:44,960
You brought gifts?

550
00:35:44,960 --> 00:35:46,159
You're too kind.

551
00:35:46,159 --> 00:35:47,840
Here, watch your step.

552
00:35:47,840 --> 00:35:49,639
I missed you.

553
00:35:51,280 --> 00:35:52,760
How come you're here?

554
00:35:52,760 --> 00:35:54,000
I couldn't find a job.

555
00:35:54,000 --> 00:35:55,360
Wu hooked me up with this place.

556
00:35:55,360 --> 00:35:57,559
Ping is now my dad's right-hand man.

557
00:35:57,559 --> 00:36:01,062
That's right. Cao Ping is smart and reliable.

558
00:36:01,062 --> 00:36:04,719
Now he handles most of the business.

559
00:36:04,719 --> 00:36:06,639
I see.

560
00:36:06,639 --> 00:36:10,440
Actually,
I have something important to tell you.

561
00:36:10,440 --> 00:36:14,599
Now we're basically
selling our seafood to middlemen.

562
00:36:14,599 --> 00:36:18,480
Our farming and sales channels
are pretty limited.

563
00:36:18,480 --> 00:36:22,440
So the most important part of the plan
is industrial upgrade.

564
00:36:22,440 --> 00:36:24,880
Basically,
turning the traditional farming model

565
00:36:24,880 --> 00:36:28,600
into a multi-dimensional,
integrated marine industry model,

566
00:36:28,600 --> 00:36:31,720
and building an online
and offline direct sales network.

567
00:36:31,720 --> 00:36:35,600
If we can build
a cold chain transport hub nearby,

568
00:36:35,600 --> 00:36:40,158
Changdao seafood can reach
people's tables faster and with better quality.

569
00:36:40,158 --> 00:36:41,880
Plus, we'd get better prices.

570
00:36:41,880 --> 00:36:43,720
Besides,

571
00:36:43,720 --> 00:36:46,480
Changdao has such amazing views.

572
00:36:46,480 --> 00:36:48,599
It's perfect for tourism.

573
00:36:48,599 --> 00:36:51,719
Over here we could put in

574
00:36:51,719 --> 00:36:54,719
sightseeing boardwalks, fishing,
family beachcombing,

575
00:36:54,719 --> 00:36:57,599
and summer bonfire parties.

576
00:36:57,599 --> 00:37:00,480
And the water park and beaches.

577
00:37:00,480 --> 00:37:02,347
That's right. Changdao is so beautiful.

578
00:37:02,347 --> 00:37:04,240
Tourism should've started here a long time ago.

579
00:37:04,240 --> 00:37:05,639
Uncle, you know what?

580
00:37:05,639 --> 00:37:08,159
The government is really backing
rural development these days.

581
00:37:08,159 --> 00:37:10,920
Marine ranching is a top priority.

582
00:37:10,920 --> 00:37:14,822
If we do this well,
we might even get government subsidies.

583
00:37:14,822 --> 00:37:17,000
With the government backing us,

584
00:37:17,000 --> 00:37:18,559
we must put in our full effort.

585
00:37:18,559 --> 00:37:21,119
I'll update the company when I'm back.

586
00:37:21,119 --> 00:37:24,400
Then we'll send some people for due diligence.

587
00:37:24,400 --> 00:37:26,599
Let's push this plan forward together.

588
00:37:26,599 --> 00:37:29,400
Okay. I'll have Manager Cao
fill you in on the details.

589
00:37:29,400 --> 00:37:31,440
No problem.
Looking forward to working with you.

590
00:37:31,440 --> 00:37:33,079
Looking forward to working with you.

591
00:37:40,583 --> 00:37:43,199
I didn't expect
Cao Ping to have changed so much.

592
00:37:43,199 --> 00:37:45,760
Yeah. He's been working hard these years.

593
00:37:45,760 --> 00:37:46,840
Are you really leaving?

594
00:37:46,840 --> 00:37:49,400
Why not stay a few more days?

595
00:37:49,400 --> 00:37:51,760
I want to go back and see Grandma.

596
00:37:51,760 --> 00:37:53,760
Then walk around Zhazhating.

597
00:37:54,840 --> 00:37:56,320
Remember our island tour?

598
00:37:56,320 --> 00:37:58,400
That was ages ago.

599
00:37:59,300 --> 00:38:01,860
If only we could all meet up again.

600
00:38:03,639 --> 00:38:07,980
Let those good memories stay in that summer.

601
00:38:07,980 --> 00:38:09,821
We're moving forward.

602
00:38:10,880 --> 00:38:11,920
You're right.

603
00:38:11,920 --> 00:38:13,760
Move forward.

604
00:38:38,880 --> 00:38:40,519
Grandma,

605
00:38:41,320 --> 00:38:43,679
I'm late.

606
00:38:46,559 --> 00:38:48,639
I'm here to see you.

607
00:38:50,600 --> 00:38:56,457
Are you doing okay in the other world?

608
00:38:58,719 --> 00:39:00,360
Grandma,

609
00:39:01,519 --> 00:39:03,559
I miss you so much.

610
00:39:17,320 --> 00:39:19,320
Seven yuan is way too much.

611
00:39:19,320 --> 00:39:20,599
You really are...

612
00:39:20,599 --> 00:39:23,280
Qing Ye, how come we're meeting again so fast?

613
00:39:23,280 --> 00:39:25,400
I'm here on a business trip this time.

614
00:39:25,400 --> 00:39:28,639
I left in a hurry last time
and didn't get a chance to look around.

615
00:39:28,639 --> 00:39:29,800
Let me know if you need anything.

616
00:39:29,800 --> 00:39:32,280
Will do. Thanks, Uncle Zhao.

617
00:39:46,840 --> 00:39:47,840
Qing Ye.

618
00:39:47,840 --> 00:39:49,677
Grandma Zhao.

619
00:39:49,677 --> 00:39:51,079
I just made some coffee.

620
00:39:51,079 --> 00:39:53,039
- Here, have a cup.
- Thank you, Grandma Zhao.

621
00:39:53,039 --> 00:39:55,639
Anything you need, I'm here.

622
00:39:55,639 --> 00:39:57,400
Grandma Zhao.

623
00:40:22,039 --> 00:40:23,840
Qing Ye, you're back.

624
00:40:24,440 --> 00:40:25,800
Try this.

625
00:40:25,800 --> 00:40:28,079
It's the upgraded Zhazha Drink.

626
00:40:28,079 --> 00:40:29,559
Okay.

627
00:40:30,719 --> 00:40:32,760
Tell me if you've got any thoughts.

628
00:41:13,960 --> 00:41:15,400
Auntie.

629
00:41:15,400 --> 00:41:18,719
Ye, you're finally here.

630
00:41:18,719 --> 00:41:20,519
Come on, give me a hug.

631
00:41:23,800 --> 00:41:24,960
You said you'd be right back.

632
00:41:24,960 --> 00:41:26,239
But you took forever.

633
00:41:26,239 --> 00:41:28,320
I almost fell asleep waiting.

634
00:41:28,320 --> 00:41:30,159
I thought you got lost.

635
00:41:30,159 --> 00:41:31,240
I was in a hurry last time.

636
00:41:31,240 --> 00:41:33,039
So I just walked around nearby.

637
00:41:33,039 --> 00:41:34,920
Look, they made me so many drinks.

638
00:41:34,920 --> 00:41:36,079
I've really had way too much.

639
00:41:36,079 --> 00:41:38,662
Auntie, I need to use the bathroom first.

640
00:41:38,662 --> 00:41:40,199
Come back, come back.

641
00:41:40,199 --> 00:41:41,719
Come on, follow me.

642
00:41:43,079 --> 00:41:44,740
Here it is.

643
00:41:50,239 --> 00:41:53,079
What do you think? Totally different, right?

644
00:41:53,079 --> 00:41:55,239
Dry-wet separation.

645
00:41:55,239 --> 00:41:59,400
We never have to worry about
someone banging on the door mid shower.

646
00:42:02,039 --> 00:42:03,480
Please.

647
00:42:21,239 --> 00:42:22,880
Stay still.

648
00:42:27,159 --> 00:42:28,920
It looks great, Auntie.

649
00:42:28,920 --> 00:42:31,280
You're getting crazy good at doing hair up.

650
00:42:31,280 --> 00:42:33,880
Just one last step.

651
00:42:33,880 --> 00:42:35,840
Okay, done.

652
00:42:35,840 --> 00:42:39,960
Beautiful.
You really are the number one in Anzi County.

653
00:42:39,960 --> 00:42:44,000
I've got to keep up with the times
and learn something new.

654
00:42:44,000 --> 00:42:46,039
Can't always do those old-fashioned hairstyles.

655
00:42:46,039 --> 00:42:49,840
You know, I've been learning a lot online.

656
00:42:49,840 --> 00:42:52,800
I've come to see
that this job needs new skills.

657
00:42:52,800 --> 00:42:58,079
Or young people won't come to me
to do their hair.

658
00:42:58,079 --> 00:42:59,960
Thumbs up to you.

659
00:43:01,199 --> 00:43:03,679
My girl is so pretty.

660
00:43:04,400 --> 00:43:06,239
Auntie,

661
00:43:06,239 --> 00:43:09,199
if I ever get married,

662
00:43:09,199 --> 00:43:11,639
I'll definitely ask you to do my hair.

663
00:43:16,440 --> 00:43:18,360
So you got a boyfriend?

664
00:43:21,920 --> 00:43:23,760
Well, let's take a photo.

665
00:43:23,760 --> 00:43:25,119
For memory's sake.

666
00:43:25,119 --> 00:43:27,800
You're not back that often, after all.

667
00:43:27,800 --> 00:43:29,239
Look here.

668
00:43:29,960 --> 00:43:31,679
One, two, three.

669
00:43:31,679 --> 00:43:32,679
Good.

670
00:43:32,679 --> 00:43:34,239
Alright, stay here for a bit.

671
00:43:34,239 --> 00:43:36,280
I'll go cook.

